Datum Calc
Copyright (c) 2026 Edgar Mendonca. MIT licence.

It bundles SolidJS (MIT), Chart.js (MIT, https://www.chartjs.org) and the IBM Plex
fonts (SIL Open Font Licence 1.1). Rust crates used by the engine and the shell are listed
in Cargo.lock; their licences are checked by `cargo deny check` (deny.toml).

The materials library (crates/core/data/materials.json) is built from Datum Atlas (MIT,
https://github.com/Edgar-Mendonca/Datum-Atlas) by tools/materials.py. Every value names its source;
those sources keep their own terms.

Product and file-format names are trademarks of their owners and are used only to describe file compatibility.
